# Convoworks WP - Cursor Rules

Always include the following documentation files in chat context:

- AGENTS.md (project overview and navigation)
- AGENTS-PROJECT-BUILD.md (build guide)
- app/AGENTS_CONVOWORKS_ADMIN_JS.md (admin GUI documentation - AngularJs mostly)
- src/AGENTS_CONVOWORKS_FWRK.md (PHP framework documentation)

These files provide essential context for understanding the project structure, build process, admin interface, and PHP framework.

